low, verification, lifecycle, finalization, node, and general relation events are typed. Legacy hash-only records remain readable. grapher history queries by entity, operation, or event type; audit validates the journal. Evidence types now explicitly cover command output, human observation, agent reports, external artifacts, and Grapher-derived state. README documents the model. Full non-embedding suite passes 49 tests.", "created_at": "2026-09-03T12:59:20+00:00", "evidence": [{"ref": "pytest tests/ -m not-embed", "summary": "49 tests passed", "type": "test"}], "id": "finding-grapher-provenance-v040", "meta": {}, "owners": [], "path": null, "provenance": {"actor_id": "codex-provenance-implementer", "actor_kind": "agent", "integrity": "declared", "recorded_at": "2026-09-03T12:59:20+00:00", "source": "codex"}, "scope": {}, "source_refs": [], "stage": null, "status": "current", "tags": ["implementation", "provenance", "history", "v0.4.0"], "title": "Grapher 0.4 structured provenance implemented", "type": "finding", "updated_at": "2026-09-03T12:59:20+00:00", "verification": "verified", "workflow_state": "completed"}, "timestamp": "2026-09-03T12:59:20+00:00"}]}
